Subject: [PATCH 8/8] grate: compile fragment MUL and schedule dependent ALU operations

Work-in-progress snapshot, 2026-11-02. Applies after patches 0001-0007.
Ten fragment readback cases passed on Surface RT in the preceding candidate.
Final cleanup and the added varying-W perspective case still need hardware
validation. This snapshot is retained for review and continuation, not marked
as a fully validated release.

Implement MUL using the fragment MAD unit, correct source modifiers and
input/temporary addressing, stage distinct interpolated operands, schedule
ALU dependencies, and configure the fragment pipeline for multiple batches.
General fragment uniforms, arbitrary immediates and texture formats remain
incomplete. See docs/3d-acceleration.md for evidence and remaining work.

